IGEL_RADEON_SPLIT_DVII
	  Split certain DVI-I connectors into a DVI-D and a VGA connector for
	  radeon devices. This is done to use the DVI-D - VGA split cable and use
	  both DVI and VGA at the same time.

	  Source: IGEL
